{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【15：53更新】今早（17日）11時許，警方接獲深水埗富昌邨富韻樓保安報案，指發現有龜隻疑從高處墮下。警員接報到場，發現龜隻已明顯死亡。警員到場調查，於大廈樓層尋獲男飼主，他涉嫌殘酷對待動物被捕。愛協職員到場跟進事件，指本案涉及一隻巴西龜。據了解，其所住單位還有另外數隻龜。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:01.585561+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:44:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:08:59.056236+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:34.829518+00:00","content_hash":"565fa83fa53bfe9b6c2171e87621ae7f7fbc0cca0b8f2b97dd0354ddab7dc670","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}